~ functions, recursion, and channeling the math module ~

channeling math

new vibes factorial(n)
vibes on
  it's giving n no more vibes than 1
  vibes on
    sending vibes 1
  vibes off
  sending vibes n * factorial(n - 1)
vibes off

new vibes hypotenuse(a, b)
vibes on
  sending vibes math.sqrt(a * a + b * b)
vibes off

manifesting factorial(5)
manifesting hypotenuse(3, 4)
manifesting math.pi
